4. Assets and artwork
---------------------

  * The launcher icon keeps the upstream LSPosed-style artwork (GPL-3.0) with a teal
    recolour. Every other icon comes from Material's icon set (Apache-2.0). No other
    third-party artwork is bundled.
  * `manager/src/main/assets/keystore` is **not** third-party material: it is the
    maintainer's own release keystore, shipped so that a patched app is signed with the
    same certificate as the manager. Because it is published here, treat it as a public
    key and import your own keystore before distributing your own builds — see the
    "Changes in this fork" section of `README.md`.
